Z||000017||Monkeyman||01-15-2001||04:46 PM||||Scott--I'm obviously stupid.  I had planned that originally, but got all caught up in this customization thing and forgot all about that.  Duh! to me.  I may try them in both places and see which I like better.  Thanx for reminding me.  In case I forget to ask WTIII, does he have anything behind his to keep some of the heat off of them or would it even matter?<P>Phil--They're JBLs and they come with a surface mount and a flush mount. ||||reg||1
